  <metadata>
    <name>COFFEE — Melbourne CBD street-art run</name>
    <desc>One continuous running route spelling underlined COFFEE on the Hoddle Grid. Letter tops: Lonsdale Street; middle bars: Little Bourke Street; bottoms: Bourke Street; connecting underline: Little Collins Street. Retrace the letter arms as recorded. Use footpaths and legal pedestrian crossings, waiting for signals; GPX follows mapped street alignments. No buildings or private arcades. C: Spencer; O: King/William; F: Queen; F: Elizabeth; E: Swanston; E: Russell. North-up lettering follows the natural rotation of Melbourne streets.</desc>
  </metadata>
